
Fact party Identified by String

Placeholder provider For party
Placeholder compute-provider For party
Placeholder consumer For party
Placeholder reviewer For party

Fact asset Identified by String
Placeholder resource For asset

Fact purpose Identified by String
Placeholder intended-purpose For purpose

Fact session Identified by String
Placeholder job For session

Fact controls
    Identified by provider * resource

Fact accepted-terms
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job

Fact authorised-purpose
    Identified by provider * resource * intended-purpose

Fact session-purpose
    Identified by job * intended-purpose


Fact admission-approved
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job

Fact admitted
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job

Fact admission-prerequisites-met
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job
    Holds when controls(provider, resource)
        && accepted-terms(compute-provider, resource, job)
        && session-purpose(job, intended-purpose)
        && authorised-purpose(provider, resource, intended-purpose)

Act approve-admission
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates admission-approved(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when controls(provider, resource)
        && admission-prerequisites-met(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)

Act request-access
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job
    Creates admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
    Holds when admission-prerequisites-met(
        provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && admission-approved(
            provider, compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)


Fact operation
    Identified by String

Placeholder requested-operation For operation

Fact operating-conditions-met
    Identified by provider * resource * job

Fact operation-purpose
    Identified by requested-operation * intended-purpose

Fact step-executed
    Identified by compute-provider * resource * job * requested-operation

Fact step-permitted
    Identified by provider * compute-provider * resource * intended-purpose * job * requested-operation
    Holds when admitted(
        compute-provider, resource, intended-purpose, job)
        && operating-conditions-met(provider, resource, job)
        && operation-purpose(requested-operation, intended-purpose)
        && controls(provider, resource)

Act authorise-step
    Actor compute-provider
    Recipient provider
    Related to resource, intended-purpose, job, requested-operation
    Creates step-executed(
        compute-provider, resource, job, requested-operation)
    Holds when step-permitted(
        provider, compute-provider, resource,
        intended-purpose, job, requested-operation)

Act suspend-session
    Actor provider
    Recipient compute-provider
    Related to resource, job
    Terminates operating-conditions-met(provider, resource, job)
    Holds when controls(provider, resource)
        && operating-conditions-met(provider, resource, job)
